<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian president leaves for Germany.</title>
<headline>Tunisian president leaves for Germany.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali and his wife Leila left Tunis on Wednesday for a three-day visit to Germany, the official Tunisia news agency TAP said.</p>
<p>The visit is at the invitation of Germany's President Roman Herzog, it added.</p>
<p>Economic and financial cooperation, including partnerships in the private sector, will feature in Ben Ali's talks, the Tunisian newspaper La Presse said on Wednesday.</p>
